OL,3,GNEWSAGang paid for extra baggage to
OL,4,Asmuggle 460kg of drugs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gang of drug smugglers paid extra
OL,7,Fbaggage charges as they attempted to
OL,8,Fsmuggle 22 suitcases packed with
OL,9,Fcannabis from Thailand to Birmingham.
OL,11,FThe 11-strong group travelled via
OL,12,FCharles de Gaulle Airport in Paris and
OL,13,Fwere arrested at Birmingham Airport on
OL,14,F9 August 2024.
OL,16,FUK Border Force seized 460kg (1,014lb)
OL,17,Fof the Class B drug, which had a street
OL,18,Fvalue of #13.8m.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
