OL,3,GNEWSAGang paid for extra baggage to
OL,4,Asmuggle 460kg of drugs
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach person was arrested with two large
OL,7,Fsuitcases containing 20kg (44lb) of
OL,8,Fcannabis that were so heavy they had to
OL,9,Fpay an excess charge at Bangkok Airport
OL,10,Fto put them in the hold.
